# The desktop app is built and shipped separately — none of it belongs in a
# deployment. `desktop/` alone is ~1 GB with its Electron binaries and release
# artefacts, and the web app never imports from it.
desktop

# Binaries are served from a release host, not from the deployment. Uploading a
# 250 MB pair of disk images on every deploy is slow, and Git ignores them
# anyway, so a CLI deploy from a working copy is the only way they could sneak
# in. Point MERIT_DESKTOP_MAC_*_URL at the hosted artefacts instead.
public/downloads

# Local-only.
.env
.env.*
tests
